{"id":2967,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p><strong>党建领航承八五薪火，劳动筑梦育时代新人</strong></p><p>——信息与通信工程学院党委与后勤管理部党总支联合开展主题党日活动暨“信合耕读园\"劳动教育实践基地揭牌仪式</p><p>5月20日上午，信息与通信工程学院党委与后勤管理部党总支在后勤苗圃基地联合开展主题党日活动，并举行“信合耕读园”劳动教育实践基地揭牌仪式，以躬身实践的实际行动向中北大学建校85周年献礼。信息与通信工程学院院长王黎明、后勤管理部党总支书记杨湖、后勤管理部副部长杨亚军、张耀华以及双方师生党员代表出席活动，仪式由学院党委副书记兼副院长么兰主持。<br></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Enz6e2MNQ7U4L8MyRNPMmlDLRNDo77hiM4nRL4LbUmUiUz70gihFp2hmCIa0nShfnkyZLkyZMl-bLz-DoR98MRQRMmQkLRNsolUYLmTRolnFnmn2L8UPoRMFoz7iUmLJqjfTQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM4NZoSbw6238c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.jpeg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/EAD8085B912688446C66B0979D229C9D/F4F3D183/915B3\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"400\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EnmveDLmVVMNVkoy77DMzGanRfRL4rh2olLDMm6RoRlbnRC0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyaMkh7Mkh7nNnRLz-YL49aUz-YnzTfUzCbL7WknRr7LzrFU8-sLNVfLRfFMz6RUzQRgtXaQIveo4Oe_dAb6dAjCYhXptQ0g47aLmL0LzvboRNJqd3nx&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>后勤管理部党总支书记杨湖在致辞中表示，“信合耕读园”的建立，是党建工作与育人工作深度融合的创新探索，更是后勤服务育人、实践育人的重要载体。他希望后勤的党员同志与学院同学们携手并肩、动手实践，在田间地头践行初心使命，让党员先锋模范风采在劳动实践中充分彰显。</p><p></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EoRUeaLzQVLz7sLylrfozGbLzNDnlVhRM7Q7MlQfnmrRnz-0gihFp2hmCIa0nSybM1y4U1ybL4rfolU4nm9DMR67MzGbM4U8U8LDUllaL7MFoz-DMR9sUlnFL8lDM4lJv2bjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47soz9bgtA8pU3cc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/E963B935A9D3F8647D509744CC6AE00C/926487AD/3E675\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 300px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=ELzfeVUzARMmM2Ly4vYLzlPoRN8n7QhVnNCsLzAfnzMRnRv0gihFp2hmCIa0nkh7MYhRnSyZLz-8UzMRn7LioRf2Lz-bM7lanmUaLlU4U4AFnzTRUzLYnNrFU4Cso7CJv2bjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47soz9bgtA8pU3cc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.png\"></p><p>信息与通信工程学院院长王黎明强调，“信合耕读园”将劳动教育与专业教育、思政教育有机结合，打破了课堂与实践的壁垒，是学院“做中学”课程项目从实验室走向田间地头、实现知行合一的生动实践。他鼓励同学们充分发挥信息技术专业优势，积极探索智慧农业相关小实践、小创新，将专业知识与劳动实践紧密结合；同时寄语全体同学，要以劳树德、以劳增智、以劳强体、以劳育美，在亲身劳动中锤炼品格、增长才干、提升素养。&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EoRNesUmCin77bny7UsnNQ7M8QkLNrhfUmNZUzGYM4LbnNl0gihFp2hmCIa0n1hfnSyYLSy4Lzv8nl-DLlCYUmvPnRAVn7r2Ll-ZLzL8M7WFLz-iLmCDMmWFMm7YLR-JqjfTQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM4NZoSbw6238c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.jpeg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/FAE213174EB61F2B71D8EDEF1B81344B/12526662/61202\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"300\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EU8refUmf7UNlbUylW7n7UbMR-8L8VhRMRLZozLbn7lDU8L0gihFp2hmCIa0nSyioSyiUShVolCiMmT7MN-DM4WkMlU8L7-aLR9ZLNC4U8rFo7-sM8L8UNQFL49PnzAkgtXaQIveo4Oe_dAb6dAjCYhXptQ0g47aLmL0LzvboRNJqd3nx&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.jpeg\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>劳动教育实践导师谢荣芳老师表态，将以严谨负责的态度，带领同学们从花盒培育、种子撒播等基础劳动入手，逐步引导大家掌握劳动技能，在亲身劳作中培养耐心与责任心，让劳动教育真正落地生根。学生代表周涵旭代表全体参与同学承诺，将以饱满的热情投入到劳动实践中，用汗水浇灌希望，用繁花告白母校，为建校85周年增添亮色。&nbsp; &nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EoR6eRL49ZMm-YUy4Wkolr2MRLYUzfhRnlWVMlLDMNLZnNU0gihFp2hmCIa0U1hVokybM1yPLlQ2nz7ZL87sMm98nzQRollbU4CYUmCDMzAFM8LaUmCZMNVFMR-4UzGJqjfTQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM4NZoSbw6238c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.jpeg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BE89611FFE183A7684E6C9E9C62B6658/7C0B686A/423A0\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"300\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Eol7ePU4QRM8CPMylVkLmL4UzCYUllhZM4MRnzWfozCsMml0gihFp2hmCIa0MkhVU1yiM1y4Ul-iL4fVL77inl-aL4NPMm9snmNZo7U4U4fFLR7iLzLPLzMFLNCinNC4gtXaQIveo4Oe_dAb6dAjCYhXptQ0g47aLmL0LzvboRNJqd3nx&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.jpeg\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EMRTeVn7CDn7CaUy8VVLNrRLR9Po77hZnmLiM4CbUzl8U8L0gihFp2hmCIa0UShkUYyinSy8nmN4MRL8olUZozUYMRNPM4-8MNL8nRNaM4nFMlrRMN-aMNrFMRWkozCJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47soz9bgtA8pU3cc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/ABC5E4F934349D89424917246C4D9074/5EC6B06E/42B96\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 300px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EoRfeVU8rko77DnymL8Lm9DnRGYUl7hDU4-iMzlPnm9DMm70gihFp2hmCIa0UYyinkyanShRo7UaLmfRol-snRfVL8lYnRvPUz-sMNrkLzWFozrkozvYM4QFU4CDM8LJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47soz9bgtA8pU3cc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.jpg\"></p><p></p><p>仪式现场，王黎明院长、杨湖书记等双方领导共同为“信合耕读园”揭牌，随后为劳动教育实践导师颁发聘书。仪式结束后，全体参会人员合影留念，并一同参观了苗圃花房，详细了解各类花卉、作物的培育情况。</p><p></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EU8re2M46RoR98Uy4UPozNPLl-PMRNhbnNUsL7QVMNCbnz-0gihFp2hmCIa0okyDLSh7LYyZUm9YUmWRozlPL4U8UN7sLznRnmWRM47YnzVFoR-ZUmCan7WFozUZM4lJqjfjo4OeosAZ_5nZQDL0qIbtpYyPLR-4g47soz9bgtA8pU3cc&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/861D38B82B2C951344BA714CF2C712E1/828B60DB/94875\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"300\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EU4NeDnRUsnNU4nym7ioz-aLlCbMRvhYMNlbnz7aL7QRLzL0gihFp2hmCIa0Lkh2L1yZL1h2Lzv8UzvPnllZLRL8M4lZLmM2nRlsn7VRnzAFUNnVnzlPLRTFL4LbUzM2gtXaQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM4NZoSbw6238c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.jpg\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EMzle4LNrkLR7YMy7QRM4lanlU4olnhVnmNDMzNinmTRoR70gihFp2hmCIa0n1yYL1hfnSyYL7M7oR-inzn7MlCinzTfU47bozCDLl-4n7nFol7iUlV7olVFol7aUlUJqjfTQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM4NZoSbw6238c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.jpeg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F22AE20CD825E4D5F5E9AC199661B3DD/9A5AAD9A/9A0AD\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"300\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EM7Ue8M8VRM878Ly4n7Ul7DollbozfhkUlrRU4CsMN74L4N0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyiM1ysMkh7L7LbnRGsLmlDol-PnN7DLznRUzAVUzWknzAFMNrfoRvio7nFU8nVMNCigtXaQIveo4Oe_dAb6dAjCYhXptQ0g47aLmL0LzvboRNJqd3nx&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.jpeg\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>随后，首次劳动体验活动正式开展。在劳动教育实践导师及后勤党员同志的悉心指导下，同学们分组行动，亲手进行吊兰移栽、翻土整地、播种育苗、施肥养护等农事劳动，大家分工协作、干劲十足，现场气氛热烈而有序，每一位参与者都在亲身劳作中体会到了劳动的价值与乐趣。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EMzNe8MR9Znm-YnyzNYL4n7olnVLzvhYMRC4U4TRnmnRnmN0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhkUYy8L1y8M8W2nlMknz7snRWVLRCDMmT2LRTkUln7LmWFnm6kozNYnz6FU8rfU8CJqjfTQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM4NZoSbw6238c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.jpeg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/DBC4247BFECBE17D2E06669F09BADD22/F7B992E7/CEACF\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 300px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EUmlebMzNYLmLbMymCiUmMkMNn2UNQh2o7LiUmliL7UDMz70gihFp2hmCIa0MYysMkyDMkyaLzLDoRQRM7-ZUmlbM7nRLl-DU87ioRGZL4nFLzM7MNV7MlnFoRl8n7rRgtXaQIveo4Oe_dAb6dAjCYhXptQ0g47aLmL0LzvboRNJqd3nx&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.jpeg\">&nbsp;<img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EnR7eDU4QfMmv8My4vDnlMRUmVfnllh8MN7PU4lao7nkLlU0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yPM1ybUYybo7VRnmN8nmvaU8rfMmGsoll8Lz-PLmUaL8QFo7rkUzLYLmnFol7YMm7JqjfTQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM4NZoSbw6238c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.jpeg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B169C98ACF94F70CEA6079E41212403F/8EBA3224/9A261\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 300px\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=EUzLebMzLaU4r7oy7r7MRWRLmLZMz6hRoz7soR7ioz-8nR70gihFp2hmCIa0USyiLSy8U1yioR7bLN7iLzGaMl-sL8UZU4QVL7VkLzAfLlnFL4viL4G8nzAFnRC8M4-ZgtXaQIveo4Oe_dAb6dAjCYhXptQ0g47aLmL0LzvboRNJqd3nx&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.jpeg\"></p><p>“信合耕读园”的建立，是信息与通信工程学院落实立德树人根本任务、深化“五育并举”教育方针的重要举措。未来，学院将以该实践平台为依托，鼓励教师结合“做中学”项目，将劳动教育融入教学实践，着力将“信合耕读园”打造成集党建引领、劳动实践、师生互动于一体的特色阵地，助力学生全面发展、成长成才。&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p><br><br></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://5y.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Enz6e2MNQ7U4L8MyRNPMmlDLRNDo77hiM4nRL4LbUmUiUz70gihFp2hmCIa0nShfnkyZLkyZMl-bLz-DoR98MRQRMmQkLRNsolUYLmTRolnFnmn2L8UPoRMFoz7iUmLJqjfTQ4Oeo4xZ_dT8_26mgDTJQty0LzGYLYyPM4NZoSbw6238c&oid=1059493349&tid=1023&nid=17989&e=.jpeg"}